## Architecture Change Gate

**Ask the user first.** Before implementing anything that changes system boundaries, signing model, or security invariants — pause and get explicit approval.

**Then update docs** in the same change set:

| Trigger | Update |
|---|---|
| New container / external system | `docs/architecture.md` C1–C2 |
| New component group / flow | `docs/architecture.md` C3–C4 |
| Invariant change | `project-bible.md` §2 + this file |

## Architecture Change Checklist

```text
[ ] User explicitly approved architecture change
[ ] docs/architecture.md updated
[ ] project-bible.md updated if invariants changed
[ ] architecture-c4.mdc updated if guardrails changed
[ ] No private keys introduced
[ ] Ledger access remains WebHID in apps/web only (never backend)
[ ] Canonical payload changes have migration plan
[ ] Audit events for new mutations
[ ] Tests for new behavior
[ ] .env.example updated
[ ] No mainnet funds before testnet POC passes
```
